497 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 130 0 R/T(01 Heat 2 tbsp oil in a pot over medium heat. Saute half the garlic until golden, about 1 minute. 02 Add broccoli, bell pepper, salt, and pepper; cover and steam 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. 03 Add 1 tbsp oil and remaining garlic to the pot; cook until golden. 04 Add shrimp and seasoning; cook 3-5 minutes until opaque. 05 Return vegetables to the pot, stir in lemon juice, and serve. PRO TIP Serve over cauliflower rice, quinoa, or greens.)/E(01 Heat 2 tbsp oil in a pot over medium heat. Saute half the garlic until golden, about 1 minute. 02 Add broccoli, bell pepper, salt, and pepper; cover and steam 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. 03 Add 1 tbsp oil and remaining garlic to the pot; cook until golden. 04 Add shrimp and seasoning; cook 3-5 minutes until opaque. 05 Return vegetables to the pot, stir in lemon juice, and serve. PRO TIP Serve over cauliflower rice, quinoa, or greens.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[13]>>
