641 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 140 0 R/T(01 Heat oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat. 02 Add beef and cook until browned and just cooked through, about 3-4 minutes. Remove from pan. 03 Add garlic and ginger to the same pan; cook until fragrant. 04 Add vegetables and stir-fry until tender-crisp, about 5-7 minutes. 05 Return beef to the pan, add coconut aminos or tamari, and toss. 06 Cook 2 more minutes until heated through. 07 Serve hot with sesame seeds and a squeeze of lime.)/E(01 Heat oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat. 02 Add beef and cook until browned and just cooked through, about 3-4 minutes. Remove from pan. 03 Add garlic and ginger to the same pan; cook until fragrant. 04 Add vegetables and stir-fry until tender-crisp, about 5-7 minutes. 05 Return beef to the pan, add coconut aminos or tamari, and toss. 06 Cook 2 more minutes until heated through. 07 Serve hot with sesame seeds and a squeeze of lime.)/Pg 42 0 R/K[11]>>
