<</Title(An anti-inflammatory diet focuses on consuming foods that reduce inflammation and avoiding those that trigger it. This approach emphasizes whole, unprocessed foods rich in nutrients, antioxidants, and healthy fats.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1402 0 R/Prev 1504 0 R/Next 1505 0 R>>
endobj

