<</Title(\200 1 cup Medjool dates, pitted \200 1/2 cup shredded unsweetened coconut \200 1/2 cup ground flaxseed \200 1 tbsp coconut oil \200 1 tsp vanilla extract \200 A pinch of salt)/Dest[51 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1508 0 R>>
endobj

1613 0 obj
<</Title(01 Blend dates in a food processor until sticky. 02 Mix in coconut, flaxseed, coconut oil, vanilla, and salt until well combined. 03 Roll into small balls and refrigerate for 30 minutes. 04 Enjoy as a quick energy snack.)/Dest[51 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1509 0 R>>
endobj

