1615 0 obj
<</Title(Improved Mental Health: Reducing inflammation has been linked to lower rates of depression and improved cognitive function.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1506 0 R/Prev 1623 0 R/Next 1607 0 R>>
endobj

1616 0 obj
<</Title(\200 Fruits and Vegetables: Rich in antioxidants, vitamins, and minerals. Berries, leafy greens, tomatoes, broccoli, and cauliflower are particularly beneficial. \200 Healthy Fats: Omega-3 fatty acids in fatty fish, flaxseeds, and walnuts help reduce inflammation. Extra virgin olive oil is another excellent source. \200 Whole Grains: Choose oats, brown rice, quinoa, and barley for fiber and nutrients. \200 Lean Proteins: Include chicken, turkey, tofu, legumes, fish, and seafood.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1608 0 R/Next 1624 0 R>>
endobj

