<</Title(\200 2 large apples, cored \200 1/4 cup chopped nuts: walnuts or almonds \200 1 tsp cinnamon \200 1 tsp coconut oil or ghee \200 Optional: a sprinkle of ground ginger)/Dest[50 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1610 0 R>>
