1621 0 obj
<</Title(01 Preheat oven to 350\260F \(175\260C\). 02 Stuff each apple with nuts and sprinkle cinnamon inside. 03 Drizzle with coconut oil or ghee. 04 Bake for 20-25 minutes until tender. 05 Serve warm.)/Dest[50 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1611 0 R>>
